# Secrets & local config.
#
# The leading `/` ANCHORS the pattern at the root. Without it, the homonymous TEMPLATES
# in `templates/repo/` would be ignored — they are the product of this repo.
#
# That is not enough: `templates/repo/.gitignore` is itself an ACTIVE .gitignore,
# and a deeper .gitignore always beats the root one. It therefore ignores its
# own neighbors `.envrc` and `CLAUDE.md`. They are tracked via `git add -f` — an
# already-tracked file escapes .gitignore. Do NOT `git rm --cached` them.
/.env
/.envrc
/.claude/

.DS_Store
*.log
*.bak
*.bak-*

# Pinned binaries that `check.sh` downloads to align local with CI.
/.ci-tools/
